From: FRLG Trade Broker contributors
Subject: [RFC] expose Gen 3 trade-emulator events to the broker

Base: GB-Link/GBLink-Firmware 2facc86bc7292b1adad436ba8ebd5a7ccd649c12

This RFC patch records the smallest reviewed integration points. It is NOT yet
buildable: copy firmware/gb-link into src/broker, add a real Zephyr SHA-256
binding, and resolve the explicit commit marker with hardware tests first.

